@bank all
// Head writer 0607: the Calendar's words and the postcard (the traditions engineer's, plan-0607 "The Calendar").
// TEXTS. {n} a count, {trad} a tradition's name.

== cal.count
- {n} traditions today

== cal.one
- 1 tradition today

== cal.none
- No traditions today. A quiet one.

== cal.same
- same time as {trad}

== cal.member
- You're a member

== cal.title
- The next 7 days

== postcard.write
- Write a postcard home

== postcard.sent
- Your card is in the box. It goes out with the next mail run.
